## 🚫 Anti-Patterns to Avoid

### DON'T Skip Tests
❌ Never comment out failing tests
❌ Never skip tests with `.skip()`
❌ Never disable tests to "fix later"

**Instead**: Fix the test or fix the code

### DON'T Write Flaky Tests
❌ `await page.waitForTimeout(1000)` (arbitrary waits)
✅ `await page.waitForSelector('[data-testid="element"]')` (wait for condition)

❌ Relying on timing
✅ Relying on state

### DON'T Test Implementation Details
❌ Testing internal state
❌ Testing CSS classes or styles
✅ Testing user-visible behavior
✅ Testing actual functionality

### DON'T Write Tests Without data-testid
❌ `await page.click('.btn.primary.large')`
✅ `await page.click('[data-testid="login-button"]')`

