## 🏗️ Component Requirements for Testability

### Always Add data-testid Attributes

```tsx
// ✅ Good - Easy to test
<button data-testid="login-button">Login</button>
<div data-testid="error-message">{error}</div>
<form data-testid="login-form">...</form>

// ❌ Bad - Hard to test
<button className="btn-primary">Login</button>
<div className="error">{error}</div>
<form>...</form>
```

### Naming Convention for data-testid
- Use kebab-case
- Be descriptive and specific
- Include context when needed
- Examples:
  - `login-button`
  - `email-input`
  - `error-message`
  - `home-page`
  - `credential-list`
  - `save-credential-button`

